  "slug": "sangria-barcelona-style",
  "name": "Sangria Barcelona Style",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "This is sangria as seen in Barcelona; it only takes 15 minutes to make!",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place the lemon, orange, and brown sugar in a large pitcher. Pour in vodka, Cointreau, gin, orange soda, lemon-lime soda, pineapple juice, and orange juice. Add ice cubes and pour in red wine; stir well until the sugar has dissolved."
    }
